abstract: "Makes hazard layers for the ShakeReady map: from USGS National Seismic Hazard Model tables, USGS ShakeMaps and tables of points, or by computing the shaking of a described earthquake with a ground-motion model. Every layer is checked and carries a record of its source. A browser app and a command-line tool that are tested to produce the same layers."
keywords:
  - earthquake
  - seismic hazard
  - ground motion
  - ShakeMap
  - ShakeReady
